 drivers/gpu/drm/amd/amdgpu/gfx_v11_0.c  | 48 +++-------------------
 drivers/gpu/drm/amd/amdgpu/gfx_v12_0.c  | 49 +++-------------------
 4 files changed, 67 insertions(+), 87 deletions(-)

